---
// src/pages/index.astro
import '../styles/custom.css';
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<title>Michael Uzukwu - Technical Writer & Documentation Engineer</title>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="description" content="Technical Writer specializing in API documentation, developer portals, and docs-as-code" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<script is:inline>
			(function() {
				const theme = localStorage.getItem('theme') || 'dark';
				document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', theme);
			})();
		</script>
	</head>
	<body>
		<!-- Navigation -->
		<nav class="portfolio-nav">
			<div class="nav-container">
				<a href="/" class="nav-logo">Michael Uzukwu</a>
				<div class="nav-links">
					<a href="#home">Home</a>
					<a href="#services">Services</a>
					<a href="#about">About</a>
					<a href="#work">Work</a>
					<a href="#writing">Writing</a>
					<a href="#opensource">Open Source</a>
					<a href="#talks">Talks</a>
					<a href="#contact">Contact</a>
				</div>
				<button id="theme-toggle" class="theme-toggle" aria-label="Toggle theme">
					<svg class="icon-sun" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
						<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/>
						<path d="M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.93 4.93l1.41 1.41M17.66 17.66l1.41 1.41M2 12h2M20 12h2M6.34 17.66l-1.41 1.41M19.07 4.93l-1.41 1.41"/>
					</svg>
					<svg class="icon-moon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
						<path d="M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z"/>
					</svg>
				</button>
			</div>
		</nav>

		<!-- Hero -->
		<section id="home" class="hero">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="hero-content">
					<div class="hero-text">
						<span class="hero-badge">Open to opportunities</span>
						<h1 class="hero-title">Michael Uzukwu</h1>
						<p class="hero-tagline">Technical Writer & Documentation Engineer</p>
						<p class="hero-description">
							I transform complex technical systems into documentation developers actually use.
							Specializing in API documentation, developer tooling, and cloud-native infrastructure.
							Recently completed an LFX-CNCF mentorship for kgateway.
						</p>
						<div class="hero-actions">
							<a href="#work" class="hero-btn">View My Work</a>
							<a href="#contact" class="hero-btn secondary">Get In Touch</a>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="hero-image">
						<img src="/michael-photo.jpg" alt="Michael Uzukwu" class="profile-photo" />
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Services -->
		<section id="services" class="section">
			<div class="container">
				<span class="section-label">Services</span>
				<h2>What I Do</h2>
				<p class="section-intro">Documentation work grounded in engineering workflows, not just writing.</p>
				<div class="services-grid">
					<div class="service-card">
						<div class="icon-box">
							<svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
								<path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"/>
								<path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"/>
							</svg>
						</div>
						<h3>API Documentation</h3>
						<p>API references, developer guides, and integration tutorials that help developers adopt a product quickly and confidently.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="service-card">
						<div class="icon-box">
							<svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
								<path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/>
							</svg>
						</div>
						<h3>Documentation Engineering</h3>
						<p>Docs-as-code workflows, static site generators, CI/CD pipelines, and documentation infrastructure that scales with the product.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="service-card">
						<div class="icon-box">
							<svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
								<path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
							</svg>
						</div>
						<h3>Security & Identity Docs</h3>
						<p>OIDC, OAuth 2.0, and JWT integration guides tested against real identity providers like Keycloak, Auth0, and Okta.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="service-card">
						<div class="icon-box">
							<svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
								<polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/>
							</svg>
						</div>
						<h3>AI-Augmented Workflows</h3>
						<p>Building and using AI tools to automate repetitive documentation tasks, generate descriptions, and detect API changes.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- About -->
		<section id="about" class="section">
			<div class="container">
				<span class="section-label">About</span>
				<h2>About Me</h2>
				<div class="about-content">
					<div class="about-text">
						<div class="about-photo-mobile">
							<img src="/michael-photo-about.jpg" alt="Michael Uzukwu" class="profile-photo" />
						</div>
						<p>My journey in technical communication began during my high school days as Chief Editor of the Press Club, where I discovered my passion for transforming complex ideas into clear, accessible content.</p>
						<p>Today, I specialize in creating comprehensive documentation that helps developers and businesses succeed with technical products. I believe great documentation doesn't just explain features—it empowers users to achieve their goals with confidence and clarity.</p>
						<p>In 2026, I completed an LFX-CNCF mentorship for kgateway, where I documented OIDC and JWT integrations for identity providers including Keycloak, Auth0, and Okta. I authored 14+ documentation pull requests, created 5 integration guides, and developed a reusable template for identity provider documentation.</p>
						<p>I thrive on contributing to open-source projects and leading documentation initiatives that improve developer experience.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="about-sidebar">
						<div class="about-photo-desktop">
							<img src="/michael-photo-about.jpg" alt="Michael Uzukwu" class="profile-photo" />
						</div>
						<div class="about-skills">
							<div class="skill-card">
								<h3>Documentation Tools</h3>
								<div class="skill-items">
									<div class="skill-item">Astro Starlight</div>
									<div class="skill-item">Docusaurus</div>
									<div class="skill-item">Hugo</div>
									<div class="skill-item">MkDocs</div>
									<div class="skill-item">VuePress</div>
									<div class="skill-item">GitBook</div>
								</div>
							</div>
							<div class="skill-card">
								<h3>Core Expertise</h3>
								<div class="skill-items">
									<div class="skill-item">API Documentation</div>
									<div class="skill-item">Docs-as-Code</div>
									<div class="skill-item">Developer Portals</div>
									<div class="skill-item">Documentation Audits</div>
									<div class="skill-item">Content Strategy</div>
									<div class="skill-item">Open Source</div>
								</div>
							</div>
							<div class="skill-card">
								<h3>Technical Skills</h3>
								<div class="skill-items">
									<div class="skill-item">Markdown</div>
									<div class="skill-item">YAML</div>
									<div class="skill-item">Git/GitHub</div>
									<div class="skill-item">CI/CD</div>
									<div class="skill-item">REST APIs</div>
									<div class="skill-item">Python</div>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Work -->
		<section id="work" class="section">
			<div class="container">
				<span class="section-label">Selected Work</span>
				<h2>Projects I Have Built</h2>
				<p class="section-intro">Documentation projects and tools I have built.</p>
				<div class="card-grid">
					<div class="card">
						<a href="https://github.com/Mike-4-prog/api2md" target="_blank" class="project-image-link">
							<img src="/api2md.png" alt="api2md" class="project-image" />
						</a>
						<h3>api2md</h3>
						<p>API documentation automation tool that converts OpenAPI specs into Markdown, detects version changes, and generates AI-powered descriptions using Ollama. The MVP is complete and currently in testing against real-world APIs.</p>
						<div class="tech-stack">
							<span>Python</span><span>OpenAPI</span><span>Ollama</span>
						</div>
						<a href="https://github.com/Mike-4-prog/api2md" target="_blank" class="project-link">View Repository</a>
					</div>

					<div class="card">
						<a href="https://refract-production.netlify.app/" target="_blank" class="project-image-link">
							<img src="/refract.png" alt="Refract Documentation" class="project-image" />
						</a>
						<h3>Refract Documentation</h3>
						<p>Technical writing capstone project featuring Docusaurus documentation with Algolia search integration and modern design patterns.</p>
						<div class="tech-stack"><span>Docusaurus</span><span>Algolia</span><span>React</span></div>
						<a href="https://refract-production.netlify.app/" target="_blank" class="project-link">Live Site</a>
					</div>

					<div class="card">
						<a href="https://omarray.netlify.app/" target="_blank" class="project-image-link">
							<img src="/openmadness.png" alt="Openmadness Documentation" class="project-image" />
						</a>
						<h3>Openmadness Documentation</h3>
						<p>Led documentation setup using VuePress with structured content architecture, navigation design, and team coordination for an open-source project.</p>
						<div class="tech-stack"><span>VuePress</span><span>GitHub</span><span>Netlify</span></div>
						<a href="https://omarray.netlify.app/" target="_blank" class="project-link">Live Site</a>
					</div>

					<div class="card">
						<a href="https://vue-js-nine-rouge.vercel.app/" target="_blank" class="project-image-link">
							<img src="/vue.js.png" alt="Vue.js Documentation" class="project-image" />
						</a>
						<h3>Vue.js Documentation</h3>
						<p>Recreated Vue.js official documentation using Astro Starlight with enhanced navigation, performance optimization, and improved developer experience.</p>
						<div class="tech-stack"><span>Astro</span><span>Starlight</span><span>Vercel</span></div>
						<a href="https://vue-js-nine-rouge.vercel.app/" target="_blank" class="project-link">Live Site</a>
					</div>

					<div class="card">
						<a href="https://armtecnigeriaenterprises.mintlify.app" target="_blank" class="project-image-link">
							<img src="/moviedb-api-screenshot.png" alt="TMDB API Documentation" class="project-image" />
						</a>
						<h3>The Movie Database API Documentation</h3>
						<p>Modern API documentation for TMDB's REST API featuring key endpoints documented with OpenAPI specs, Postman testing, and Mintlify.</p>
						<div class="tech-stack"><span>OpenAPI</span><span>Postman</span><span>Mintlify</span></div>
						<a href="https://armtecnigeriaenterprises.mintlify.app" target="_blank" class="project-link">View Documentation</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Writing -->
		<section id="writing" class="section">
			<div class="container">
				<span class="section-label">Writing</span>
				<h2>Articles & Publications</h2>
				<p class="section-intro">Technical writing published on the CNCF blog, kgateway blog, and Dev.to.</p>
				<div class="card-grid">
					<div class="card article-card">
						<div class="icon-box">
							<svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
								<path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/>
								<polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
								<line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/>
								<line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/>
							</svg>
						</div>
						<h3>Extending AI Gateways with Rust: Custom Transformations in kgateway</h3>
						<p>Published on the CNCF blog. Step-by-step guide to building a custom Envoy dynamic module in Rust and deploying it to Kubernetes with kgateway.</p>
						<div class="tech-stack"><span>CNCF</span><span>Rust</span><span>Envoy</span></div>
						<a href="https://www.cncf.io/blog/2026/05/15/extending-ai-gateways-with-rust-custom-transformations-in-kgateway/" target="_blank" class="project-link">Read on CNCF</a>
					</div>

					<div class="card article-card">
						<div class="icon-box">
							<svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
								<path d="M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5z"/>
								<path d="M6 12v5c3 3 9 3 12 0v-5"/>
							</svg>
						</div>
						<h3>My LFX Journey with kgateway: OIDC and JWT Documentation</h3>
						<p>A first-person account of the LFX-CNCF mentorship, covering the OIDC and JWT integration guides, the Okta MFA challenge, and what working with maintainers taught me.</p>
						<div class="tech-stack"><span>LFX</span><span>OIDC</span><span>JWT</span></div>
						<a href="https://kgateway.dev/blog/my-lfx-mentorship-kgateway-oidc-jwt/" target="_blank" class="project-link">Read on kgateway</a>
					</div>

					<div class="card article-card">
						<div class="icon-box">
							<svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
								<path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/>
								<polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
								<line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/>
								<line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/>
							</svg>
						</div>
						<h3>Why Early Request Header Modification Matters in API Gateways</h3>
						<p>A technical article exploring the importance of early request header control in API gateways for security, routing, and data enrichment, with practical examples from Kgateway.</p>
						<div class="tech-stack"><span>API Gateways</span><span>Security</span></div>
						<a href="https://dev.to/uzukwu_michael_91a95b823b/why-early-request-header-modification-matters-in-api-gateways-4gle" target="_blank" class="project-link">Read on Dev.to</a>
					</div>

					<div class="card article-card">
						<div class="icon-box">
							<svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
								<path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/>
								<polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
							</svg>
						</div>
						<h3>A Beginner-Friendly Guide to Docs as Code & CI/CD Pipelines</h3>
						<p>A comprehensive guide explaining the docs-as-code methodology and how to implement CI/CD pipelines for documentation workflows.</p>
						<div class="tech-stack"><span>Docs-as-Code</span><span>CI/CD</span></div>
						<a href="https://dev.to/uzukwu_michael_91a95b823b/a-beginner-friendly-guide-to-docs-as-code-cicd-pipelines-470l" target="_blank" class="project-link">Read on Dev.to</a>
					</div>

					<div class="card article-card">
						<div class="icon-box">
							<svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
								<path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/>
								<polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
							</svg>
						</div>
						<h3>From Code to Live in Minutes: Deploying My Astro Starlight Static Site on Vercel</h3>
						<p>Step-by-step guide on deploying Astro Starlight documentation sites to Vercel with best practices for performance and SEO.</p>
						<div class="tech-stack"><span>Astro</span><span>Vercel</span></div>
						<a href="https://dev.to/uzukwu_michael_91a95b823b/from-code-to-live-in-minutes-deploying-my-astro-starlight-static-site-on-vercel-49ca" target="_blank" class="project-link">Read on Dev.to</a>
					</div>

					<div class="card article-card">
						<div class="icon-box">
							<svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
								<path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
							</svg>
						</div>
						<h3>How I Added Glossary Tooltip Hover to Kgateway Docs (Using Hugo Shortcodes)</h3>
						<p>A detailed technical article explaining the implementation of a glossary tooltip system for Kgateway's documentation using Hugo shortcodes and strategic UX design.</p>
						<div class="tech-stack"><span>Hugo</span><span>UX</span></div>
						<a href="https://dev.to/uzukwu_michael_91a95b823b/how-i-added-glossary-tooltip-hover-to-kgateway-docs-using-hugo-shortcodes-1e6o" target="_blank" class="project-link">Read on Dev.to</a>
					</div>

					<div class="card article-card">
						<div class="icon-box">
							<svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
								<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
								<path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/>
							</svg>
						</div>
						<h3>Building Private Token-Gated Experiences with Midnight Network</h3>
						<p>A tutorial demonstrating privacy-preserving token gating using zero-knowledge proofs for Web3 applications.</p>
						<div class="tech-stack"><span>Zero-Knowledge</span><span>Web3</span></div>
						<a href="https://github.com/Mike-4-prog/shielded-vip-lounge" target="_blank" class="project-link">View Repository</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Open Source -->
		<section id="opensource" class="section">
			<div class="container">
				<span class="section-label">Open Source</span>
				<h2>Contributions</h2>
				<p class="section-intro">Work with CNCF projects and open source documentation initiatives.</p>
				<div class="card-grid">
					<div class="card article-card">
						<div class="icon-box">
							<svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
								<path d="M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5z"/>
								<path d="M6 12v5c3 3 9 3 12 0v-5"/>
							</svg>
						</div>
						<h3>LFX-CNCF Mentorship – kgateway OIDC/JWT Documentation</h3>
						<p>Documented OIDC and JWT integrations for identity providers including Keycloak, Auth0, and Okta.</p>
						<div class="contribution-details">
							<ul>
								<li>Authored 14+ documentation PRs merged into kgateway.dev</li>
								<li>Created 5 identity provider integration guides</li>
								<li>Solved an Okta MFA lockout loop</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
						<a href="https://kgateway.dev/blog/my-lfx-mentorship-kgateway-oidc-jwt/" target="_blank" class="project-link">Read the Journey</a>
					</div>

					<div class="card article-card">
						<div class="icon-box">
							<svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
								<path d="M9 18h6"/>
								<path d="M10 22h4"/>
								<path d="M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-4 12.7V16h8v-1.3A7 7 0 0 0 12 2z"/>
							</svg>
						</div>
						<h3>Kgateway Glossary Tooltip System</h3>
						<p>Designed a glossary tooltip system for Kgateway documentation using Hugo shortcodes.</p>
						<div class="contribution-details">
							<ul>
								<li>"One tooltip per term" placement rule</li>
								<li>Audited 30+ technical terms</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
						<a href="https://github.com/kgateway-dev/kgateway.dev/pull/484" target="_blank" class="project-link">View PR</a>
					</div>

					<div class="card article-card">
						<div class="icon-box">
							<svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
								<path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/>
							</svg>
						</div>
						<h3>Kgateway Early Request Header Modification Guide</h3>
						<p>Authored the official guide explaining security and routing concepts for API gateway configuration.</p>
						<a href="https://github.com/kgateway-dev/kgateway.dev/pull/610" target="_blank" class="project-link">View PR</a>
					</div>

					<div class="card article-card">
						<div class="icon-box">
							<svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
								<circle cx="12" cy="8" r="6"/>
								<path d="M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11"/>
							</svg>
						</div>
						<h3>Opsimate Community Leader & Documentation Lead</h3>
						<p>Leading documentation strategy for OpsiMate's open source infrastructure monitoring platform.</p>
						<div class="contribution-details">
							<ul>
								<li>Docs revamp and contributor onboarding</li>
								<li>Hacktoberfest 2025 coordination</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Talks -->
		<section id="talks" class="section">
